</surname><given-names>TJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Christiani</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>Association of heart rate variability with occupational and environmental exposure to particulate air pollution</article-title><source>Circulation</source><volume>104</volume><fpage>986</fpage><lpage>991</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11524390</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b18-ehp0115-001002"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Magari</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name><name><surname>Schwartz</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Williams</surname><given-names>PL</given-names></name><name><surname>Hauser</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>TJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Christiani</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>The association between personal measurements of environmental exposure to particulates and heart rate variability</article-title><source>Epidemiology</source><volume>13</volume><fpage>305</fpage><lpage>310</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11964932</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b19-ehp0115-001002"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mermier</surname><given-names>CM</given-names></name><name><surname>Samet</surname><given-names>JM</given-names></name><name><surname>Lambert</surname><given-names>WE</given-names></name><name><surname>Chick</surname><given-names>TW</given-names></name></person-group><year>1993</year><article-title>Evaluation of the relationship between heart rate and ventilation for epidemiologic studies</article-title><source>Arch Environ Health</source><volume>48</volume><fpage>263</fpage><lpage>269</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8357278</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b20-ehp0115-001002"><citation citation-type="